####
## Git Ignore Rules for Agentic Data Quality Triage
## Author: Mario Caesar // hello@caesarmar.io // https://caesarmar.io/
####

# --- Ignoring Todo Files
todo/*
*.todo

# --- Ignoring Local Credentials
infra/airflow/auth/*
infra/.env

# --- Ignoring Generated Local Data
data/
output/
.pytest_cache/

# --- Ignoring dbt Artifacts
warehouse/dbt/target/
warehouse/dbt/dbt_packages/

# --- Ignoring Python Cache Files
**/__pycache__/
**/*.py[cod]
*$py.class
.vscode/

# --- Ignoring Logs
*.log
*.py.log
logs/

# --- Ignoring Premium UI Dependencies, Build Output, And Local Secrets
apps/web/node_modules/
apps/web/.next/
apps/web/*.tsbuildinfo
apps/web/.env*
!apps/web/.env.example

# --- Ignoring Isolated Demo Rendering Dependencies And Output
tools/demo-video/node_modules/
tools/demo-video/.cache/
tools/demo-video/out/
tools/demo-video/*.tsbuildinfo
